          "value": "<section id=\"secret-ZdTR42XFxLQJJur0\" class=\"secret\"><p>This fine wooden cane has a hidden latch that allows a thin, razor sharp short sword to be drawn from it. Drawing and sheathing the weapon requires an action.</p><p>Detecting the cane's true nature require a successful DC 18 Intelligence (Investigation) check if examined from afar, and a successful DC 14 check if the examiner is able to hold and handle the cane while looking at it.</p></section><p>Orvinder swipes with his sword.</p>",
